# Feature: deployment

Two stacks. Never apply a Postgres runbook to D1 or a wrangler runbook to ECS.

## A. Self-hosted (Node + Postgres)

- Runtime: `server/` Express, port 3100
- DB: embedded Postgres if `DATABASE_URL` unset; else Postgres
- UI: `apps/landing` in dev; optional `SERVE_UI` static `server/ui-dist` in images
- Env: `PAPERCLIP_DEPLOYMENT_MODE`, `PAPERCLIP_DEPLOYMENT_EXPOSURE`, `PAPERCLIP_PUBLIC_URL`, `BETTER_AUTH_SECRET`
- Docker: `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml`, `docker-compose.quickstart.yml`
- Release: npm canary/stable via `.github/workflows/release.yml` (triggers on **`master`**, not `main`)
- Health: `GET /api/health`
- Docs: `doc/DEVELOPING.md`, `doc/DOCKER.md`, `doc/RELEASING.md`, `doc/DEPLOYMENT-MODES.md`

**Broken as of 2026-08-12:** Dockerfile copies missing `scripts/docker-entrypoint.sh`, `packages/mcp-server/package.json`, `packages/adapters/acpx-local/package.json`.

## B. Hosted Cloudflare (`ciutatis.com`)

| Worker | Path | Role |
|---|---|---|
| dispatcher | `workers/dispatcher` | apex/www → `LANDING_ORIGIN` |
| ciutatis-web | `apps/landing` OpenNext | public site + `/admin` |
| ciutatis-admin-api | `workers/api` | `admin.ciutatis.com/api/*` |
| status | `workers/status` | `status.ciutatis.com` |

- DB: D1 via `packages/db-cloudflare`
- Env: `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` (not `PAPERCLIP_*`)
- Deploy: manual `wrangler deploy` / `pnpm --filter @ciutatis/landing deploy`
- npm release does **not** deploy this stack
- `SUPERPARSER_URL` is empty → collaborate 503
- `LANDING_ORIGIN` in dispatcher wrangler points at `ciutatis-web.jorge-b9f.workers.dev`
- Account, D1, KV, R2 ids are committed in wrangler tomls
- Rollback: `doc/ROLLBACK-PLAN.md` (no automated Worker rollback)

## Modes

`local_trusted` | `authenticated` + `private` | `authenticated` + `public`  
See `doc/DEPLOYMENT-MODES.md`.

## CI landmine

`pr-verify.yml`, `pr-policy.yml`, `refresh-lockfile.yml`, `release.yml` all filter `branches: [master]`. This fork’s default branch is `main`.
